{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Abs","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel"],"declarations":21,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.fromCrystalData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.fromCrystalData","kind":"def","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L157-L177","doc":"Construct a `GBResidueSpectralSum` from explicit per-level\ndata.  The `mass` field is forced to the canonical decomposition\n`|descended| + Σ_ℓ residue ℓ`, and `spectral_decomposition`\nholds by `rfl`.\n\nThis is the §7c realisation point: instantiating at `R := ℝ`\nwith the crystal-basis witness values is what puts the\n(otherwise generic) decomposition on the archimedean side. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.spectral_sum_finite","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.spectral_sum_finite","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L119-L137","doc":"**Finiteness (cardinality form).**\n\nThe spectral sum `∑ ℓ : Fin S.levelBound, S.residue ℓ` is\na sum over a `Finset` of cardinality `S.levelBound`, hence\nfinite by Mathlib's standard finite-sum machinery.\n\nNote: this is the *algebraic* finiteness — the index set\n`Fin S.levelBound` has cardinality `S.levelBound` by\nconstruction, so the sum has at most `S.levelBound`\nnon-zero terms.  The *substantive* claim of\n`conj:gs-spectral-sum-finite` — that `S.levelBound` truly\nequals the confinement level `ℓ(K, q_0)` of the underlying\nbraid, so that any analytic extension of `S.residue` to\n`ℕ` vanishes above the cutoff — is the conjectural part\nand is not formalised here; see the `.md` narrative under\n\"Why a conjecture and not a theorem\". ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:gs-spectral-sum-finite","label":"conj:gs-spectral-sum-finite","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/gs-spectral-sum-finite.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.gb_residue_spectral_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.gb_residue_spectral_sum","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L110-L117","doc":"**GB residue spectral sum proposition.**  Conditional on a\n`[GBResidueSpectralSum]` instance, the spectral decomposition\nholds. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:gb-residue-spectral-sum","label":"prop:gb-residue-spectral-sum","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/gb-residue-spectral-sum.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.classical_limit_descended","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.classical_limit_descended","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L99-L108","doc":"Classical limit: when every cyclotomic residue vanishes, the\nmass reduces to the descended Markov trace.\n\nRef: [leitner2026] `prop:categorical-mass-markov`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.gradedMarkovTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.gradedMarkovTrace","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L94-L97","doc":"Convenience accessor: graded trace at level `ℓ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.residueAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.residueAt","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L89-L92","doc":"Convenience accessor: residue at level `ℓ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.spectral_decomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.spectral_decomposition","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L86-L86","doc":"Consistency: the mass is the descended term plus the sum of\nresidues over filtration levels. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:gs-spectral-decomposition-existence","label":"conj:gs-spectral-decomposition-existence","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/gs-spectral-decomposition-existence.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.mass","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L83-L83","doc":"The spectral sum: `𝔪 = |descended| + Σ_ℓ residue ℓ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.residue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.residue","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L81-L81","doc":"The cyclotomic residue at level `ℓ`, supplied by the instance.\nPer `prop:residue-at-root`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.gradedTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.gradedTrace","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L78-L78","doc":"The graded Markov trace at level `ℓ`, supplied by the instance.\nPer `prop:graded-markov-trace-from-gs-filtration`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.roots","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.roots","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L75-L75","doc":"The roots of unity indexed by filtration level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.q","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L73-L73","doc":"The substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.levelBound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.levelBound","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L71-L71","doc":"The confinement-level cutoff. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.descended","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.descended","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L69-L69","doc":"The descended (E⁰) Markov trace of the braid word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum.mk","kind":"ctor","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L67-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GBResidueSpectralSum","kind":"class","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L57-L87","doc":"**GB residue spectral sum.**\n\nThe mass of a closed braid `K` with Hecke normal form `T_w` is\n\n  𝔪(K) = |tr_M(T_w)| + Σ_{ℓ=0}^{levelBound-1} Res_{q→ζ_ℓ}(Φ_q · tr_{M,ℓ})(T_w)\n\nThe class field structure replaces the previous `opaque\ngradedMarkovTrace` and `opaque residueAtRoot` declarations:\neach instance must supply the graded trace and cyclotomic\nresidue values explicitly. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.RootOfUnity.value","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.RootOfUnity.value","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.RootOfUnity.n_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.RootOfUnity.n_pos","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.RootOfUnity.n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.RootOfUnity.n","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.RootOfUnity.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.RootOfUnity.mk","kind":"ctor","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.RootOfUnity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.RootOfUnity","kind":"structure","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GBResidueSpectralSum.lean#L48-L55","doc":"A root of unity `ζ_ℓ` at which the `ℓ`-th knot-operator energy\n`E_ℓ(q)` vanishes.  `value` is the coordinate of `ζ_ℓ` in the\nambient ring `R` (at `R := ℝ`, its real part; a full Mathlib\ntreatment would take `R := ℂ`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}